# Ronin ships the framework, not your engagement data.
# If you work boxes inside this repo, their loot/flags/notes stay local.

# --- Engagement working data (any <box>/ dir you create here) ---
**/loot/
**/recon/
**/web/
**/exploit-dev/
**/screenshots/
**/pivots/
**/chains/
scope.txt
